meta {
  name: Delete media
  type: http
  seq: 33
}

delete {
  url: {{api}}/media/{{mediaId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Deletes one of your own photos or voice notes: 204, then 404. Its upload and, for a processed photo, its two variants are removed from the storage after the commit. A photo on an entry is 409 MEDIA_ATTACHED and stays: it leaves with the entry (ADR-0048). Anyone else's, or an id that names nothing, is 404. Not refused to an unverified account: what is yours, you can always delete (ADR-0049).
}
